      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2277,
      "text": "Then she came to her people carrying him. They said, “O Mary, you have committed something monstrous!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2278,
      "text": "O sister of Aaron,[8] your father was not a man of evil, nor was your mother unchaste.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2279,
      "text": "Thereupon she pointed to him. They said, “How can we talk to someone who is still a baby in the cradle?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2280,
      "text": "Jesus said, “I am a slave of Allah. He has given me the Scripture and made me a prophet.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2281,
      "text": "He has made me blessed wherever I may be, and has enjoined upon me prayer and zakah as long as I am alive,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2282,
      "text": "and has made me dutiful to my mother, and has not made me an oppressor or disobedient.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2283,
      "text": "Peace is upon me the day I was born, the day I will die and the day I will be resurrected.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2284,
      "text": "Such was Jesus, son of Mary – a word of truth about which they are in doubt.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2285,
      "text": "It is not befitting for Allah to beget a son. Glory be to Him[9]! When He decrees a matter, He only says to it, “Be,” and it is.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2286,
      "text": "[Jesus said], “Indeed, Allah is my Lord and your Lord, so worship Him. This is a straight path.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 307,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2287,
      "text": "But the factions differed among themselves[10] [about him]. So woe to the disbelievers from the scene of a momentous Day!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 16,
